{"seq":2,"slug":"packaging-master-data-model","title":"包装主数据模型：SKU 尺寸重量、包装层级与 Cartonization 装载单元","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/loading-problem-packaging-data-model/packaging-master-data-model","wordCount":2979,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"包装主数据模型-sku-尺寸重量-包装层级与-cartonization-装载单元\">包装主数据模型：SKU 尺寸重量、包装层级与 Cartonization 装载单元</h1><p>装载率优化的第一个崩溃点几乎从不在求解器，而在主数据。一个 SKU 的箱规被录成 <code>40×30×20 cm</code> 却实际是 <code>40×30×25</code>，体积误差 25%；一个 12 件装的外箱在系统里没有对应的运输箱记录，Cartonization 就只能回退到&quot;默认箱&quot;，装载率从 85% 掉到 62%。求解器再精确，输入是错的，输出的柜型建议就是错的。本文讲那层被低估的地基：包装主数据由哪些实体、字段、标识构成，以及它为何决定后面装箱与配载能走多远。它与同章 <a href=\"./\">章节索引</a> 及后续 <a href=\"../bin-packing-heuristic-solver/\">装箱启发式求解器章节</a> 构成一条链——本文定义&quot;可装载单元的原子&quot;，后者在这些原子上做组合优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>包装主数据是一棵<strong>嵌套层级树</strong>，而不是一堆扁平的&quot;商品尺寸&quot;。同一个 SKU 在不同层级上有不同的尺寸、重量和标识，装载系统必须知道自己在哪个层级上工作。GS1 把这条链抽象为<strong>消费单元（consumer unit）→ 内包装（inner pack）→ 运输单元（shipping unit / case）→ 托盘 / 装载单元（pallet / logistic unit）→ 集装箱</strong>，每层都有独立的记录与标识（来源：GS1 General Specifications，GS1.org）。层级之间的体积不是简单加总——内包装之间有空隙，运输箱里塞防震材料，托盘上有堆叠间隙——所以<strong>有效装载体积永远小于各层体积之和</strong>。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层单元的外接体积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、其内部所有子单元体积之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>child</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum V_{\\text{child}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">child</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该层的空间填充率是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>child</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_i = \\frac{\\sum V_{\\text{child}}}{V_i}, \\qquad 0 &lt; \\eta_i &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">child</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>托盘层的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 通常最低（0.75–0.85），因为托盘脚、缠绕膜、箱体不规整都吃掉体积；集装箱层若按箱子外接体积算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1，但真正决定装载率的是箱子之间能否贴紧——这就是 3D 装箱问题的来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;物品 Item&lt;br/&gt;GTIN 各单品&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;内包装 Inner Pack&lt;br/&gt;AI 02 引用 + AI 37 计数&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;运输箱 Carton&lt;br/&gt;箱级 GTIN + 尺寸重量主数据&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;托盘 Pallet 装载单元&lt;br/&gt;SSCC AI 00 + 托盘规格&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;集装箱 Container&lt;br/&gt;ISO 668 内尺寸 + 载重&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;约束属性&lt;br/&gt;可堆叠 易碎 朝向 危险品&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;配载求解输入&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[\"物品 Item&lt;br/&gt;GTIN 各单品\"] --&gt; B[\"内包装 Inner Pack&lt;br/&gt;AI 02 引用 + AI 37 计数\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"运输箱 Carton&lt;br/&gt;箱级 GTIN + 尺寸重量主数据\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"托盘 Pallet 装载单元&lt;br/&gt;SSCC AI 00 + 托盘规格\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"集装箱 Container&lt;br/&gt;ISO 668 内尺寸 + 载重\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"约束属性&lt;br/&gt;可堆叠 易碎 朝向 危险品\"]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[\"配载求解输入\"]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>图中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 才是装载计算真正消费的东西：带尺寸、重量、层级关系与约束的<strong>可装载单元集合</strong>。主数据模型的职责，就是无损地把左侧的多层实体投影成这个集合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>标识</th>\n<th>主数据关键字段</th>\n<th>装载系统中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单品 Item</td>\n<td>GTIN-8/12/13/14</td>\n<td>单件净重、单件外尺寸（含包装）</td>\n<td>拆零拣选、Cartonization 最小原子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内包装 Inner Pack</td>\n<td>GTIN（自身）+ AI 02/37 引用母项</td>\n<td>内包尺寸、内包毛重、内装数量</td>\n<td>&quot;整包拿&quot;还是&quot;拆包&quot;的分界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运输箱 Carton</td>\n<td>GTIN-14 / ITF-14</td>\n<td>箱外尺寸、箱毛重、最大堆叠层数</td>\n<td>3D 装箱的基本长方体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘 Pallet</td>\n<td>SSCC（AI 00）</td>\n<td>托盘尺寸、皮重、最大码高、总毛重</td>\n<td>拼柜与混载的单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集装箱 Container</td>\n<td>箱号（BIC/ISO 6346）</td>\n<td>内尺寸、门尺寸、载重、容积</td>\n<td>装载问题的容器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中三个字段最容易缺失又最致命：<strong>箱毛重</strong>、<strong>最大堆叠层数</strong>、<strong>是否可侧放</strong>。缺箱毛重，配平退化成体积配平；缺堆叠层数，求解器会把 12 层重箱压在最底下的轻箱上；缺朝向约束，会给出&quot;倒放&quot;方案然后被现场拒装。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尺寸与重量的测量-单位与容差\">尺寸与重量的测量、单位与容差</h2><p>尺寸数据的可信度取决于<strong>来源方法</strong>，而不是它是不是数字。可靠性依次递减：出厂标称（制造商规格书）、自动化量方设备（静态激光 / 立体视觉量方仪，精度通常 ±5 mm 级）、手持测量（卷尺输入，误差可达 ±1–2 cm）、&quot;目测估值&quot;——最危险的一种，因为它伪装成正常字段。采购量方设备时应把标称精度与重复性一并纳入验收，并给每条尺寸标注 provenance（来源设备 + 测量时间）。</p>\n<p>重量数据还受<strong>监管强制</strong>约束。国际海事组织（IMO）《国际海上人命安全公约》（SOLAS）第 VI 章自 2016 年 7 月 1 日起要求，每个出口集装箱装船前必须提供<strong>核验总重（Verified Gross Mass, VGM）</strong>，方法一是整箱过磅，方法二是在测量基础上累加（来源：IMO SOLAS VI/2 及 MSC.1/Circ.1475 通函）。这把重量字段变成<strong>合规输入</strong>：箱毛重、托盘皮重、内装件净重三者相加就是方法二的 VGM 基础。IMO 指南给出的核验执行容差约为申报质量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>，重量误差因此不只是装载率问题，还可能触发港口拒装。</p>\n<p>体积重（dimensional weight）是同一批数据在<strong>计费侧的镜像</strong>：承运商用外接体积除以体积除数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>dim</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{dim}} = LWH / D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dim</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，计费重取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>bill</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>act</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>dim</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{bill}} = \\max(W_{\\text{act}}, W_{\\text{dim}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">act</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dim</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 随承运商与服务而变：航空货运常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6000</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6000\\ \\text{cm}^3/\\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span>（1 m³ ≈ 167 kg 的 1:6 换算），快递空运常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span>，美国国内地面服务常用英寸/磅制的 139 或 166（来源：IATA 计费重量规则及各承运商公开费率表）。<strong>同一个错误尺寸会被收两次费</strong>——一次装载率损失，一次体积重多计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gs1-标识体系与装载单元的交汇\">GS1 标识体系与装载单元的交汇</h2><p>装载系统要跨系统对接（WMS、TMS、上游 ERP、承运商 EDI），就必须用行业整数键，而不是自增主键。GS1 提供了这套键：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AI (01) GTIN</strong>——贸易项目的全球唯一标识，14 位；运输箱常用 ITF-14 条码承载。</li>\n<li><strong>AI (02) CONTENT</strong>——指向&quot;内装贸易项目的 GTIN&quot;，与 <strong>AI (37) COUNT</strong> 配对，说明一个运输箱里装了多少个哪种物品；这是表达<strong>包装层级嵌套</strong>的标准方式，而非靠约定字段名。</li>\n<li><strong>AI (00) SSCC</strong>——系列货运包装箱代码，18 位，唯一标识一个<strong>物理装载单元</strong>（托盘、箱、包裹）。SSCC 是&quot;这一托具体货&quot;的身份，GTIN 是&quot;这一类货&quot;的身份，不可混用。</li>\n<li><strong>AI (10) 批号 / (21) 序列号 / (13) 包装日期 / (15) 保质期</strong>——影响混载与堆叠（保质期先后、危险品隔离）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一张符合 <strong>GS1 Logistics Label</strong>（基于 ISO 15394）的标签，把上述 AI 编码的条码与自由文本区、承运商区组合在一张物流标签上。对接实践是：<strong>从 SSCC 解析装载单元身份，从 AI 02/37 解析层级嵌套，从箱级 GTIN 查到尺寸重量主数据</strong>——三者缺一，装载单元就退化成匿名长方体。包装类型用 UN/ECE 第 21 号建议书的代码表达，如 <code>BX</code>（箱）、<code>CT</code>（carton）、<code>BG</code>（袋）、<code>PX</code>（托盘），被 GS1 与多国海关共同采用。</p>\n<p>主数据的<strong>交换标准</strong>是 GDSN（Global Data Synchronisation Network）。其贸易项目测量模块用 <code>packagingLevelCode</code> 区分 EACH / INNER / CASE / PALLET 四个层级，每层各自携带 <code>depth</code> / <code>width</code> / <code>height</code> / <code>netWeight</code> / <code>grossWeight</code>，并用 <code>isTradeItemAConsumerUnit</code> 与 <code>isTradeItemAShippingUnit</code> 布尔位标注该层角色（来源：GS1 GDSN Trade Item 模块规范）。这套模型解决一个常见混乱：<strong>同一条尺寸记录到底描述哪一层</strong>。如果主数据里只有一组 <code>40×30×20</code>，系统无从判断它是单件还是整箱——这正是装载率低于预期的隐形主因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cartonization-从物品集合到装载单元\">Cartonization：从物品集合到装载单元</h2><p>Cartonization（装箱选箱）要回答：给定一批待发物品和一组候选箱型，<strong>把哪些物品放进哪个箱子</strong>。它的输入契约同时决定候选箱库（carton library）和每个物品的<strong>已包装尺寸</strong>。这里有个反复踩的坑：物品的&quot;产品裸尺寸&quot;与&quot;可装箱尺寸&quot;不是一回事。单件商品自带彩盒、吊牌、气泡袋，其<strong>外接尺寸</strong>才是装箱算法能用的值。主数据模型必须显式区分 <code>productDimensions</code>（裸件）与 <code>packagedDimensions</code>（含零售包装），否则 Cartonization 会算出&quot;刚好放下&quot;然后现场放不下。</p>\n<p>箱型选择的几何判据是最朴素的：内尺寸为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(L_b, W_b, H_b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的箱子，在单一朝向、单一物品尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(l, w, h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 下最多装 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\lfloor L_b/l \\rfloor \\cdot \\lfloor W_b/w \\rfloor \\cdot \\lfloor H_b/h \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>。真实问题在于<strong>允许旋转</strong>后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 有 6 种朝向组合，多物品混合时还要考虑重心与脆弱性——这是后续章节的启发式求解器要处理的。主数据在此的责任是提供<strong>完整的置换自由度</strong>：<code>allowRotation</code>（可否翻转）、<code>thisSideUp</code>（必须朝上）、<code>stackable</code>（可否承压）、<code>maxStackWeight</code>（可承压上限）。缺任何一项，求解器只能保守假设&quot;不可旋转、不可堆叠&quot;，装载率必然吃亏。</p>\n<p>对<strong>托盘/装载单元</strong>层，主数据要描述物理上限：托盘长宽（欧标 EUR1 为 1200×800 mm、工业标准为 1200×1000 mm）、最大码高、整托最大毛重。集装箱侧需要<strong>内尺寸而非外尺寸</strong>——ISO 668 下 20 英尺柜内尺寸约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5,898</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2,352</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2,393</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5{,}898 \\times 2{,}352 \\times 2{,}393</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">898</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">352</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">393</span></span></span></span></span> mm、40 英尺柜约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12,032</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2,352</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2,393</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12{,}032 \\times 2{,}352 \\times 2{,}393</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">032</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">352</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">393</span></span></span></span></span> mm、40 尺高柜内高约 2,698 mm；最大总重 20 尺柜约 30.48 t、40 尺柜约 32.5 t，扣除箱皮重后的<strong>净载重</strong>才是配载硬边界（以箱体 CSC 铭牌为准）。<strong>门尺寸</strong>同样要建模：内尺寸装得下不代表能从箱门塞进去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主数据质量与治理的工程化\">主数据质量与治理的工程化</h2><p>主数据的失效模式是可以枚举的，治理就是针对这几类做工程化拦截：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效模式</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n<th>装载后果</th>\n<th>治理手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缺尺寸</td>\n<td>字段为 0 或 null</td>\n<td>退回默认箱，装载率骤降</td>\n<td>建单即校验，缺失阻断入库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺寸漂移</td>\n<td>供应商换包装未更新</td>\n<td>系统装箱方案现场放不下</td>\n<td>周期性重量/量方复核 + 抽检触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级错配</td>\n<td>单件尺寸填成整箱尺寸</td>\n<td>体积重多计、柜数估错</td>\n<td>用 GDSN <code>packagingLevelCode</code> 显式标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重量失真</td>\n<td>标称重与实际差 &gt;5%</td>\n<td>VGM 超标被拒装</td>\n<td>定期过磅比对，超差告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束缺失</td>\n<td>无 stackable / 朝向</td>\n<td>压损、倒放被拒装</td>\n<td>上架前强制补全约束字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>治理的关键机制是<strong>来源分级 + 复核节奏</strong>：新 SKU 首次入库必须带测量 provenance 与时间；对高周转、高货值或换装频繁的 SKU，以&quot;距上次复核超过 N 天或累计差异率超阈值&quot;触发复测。尺寸是会漂移的活数据，不能用一次性大清理代替持续校验。</p>\n<p>一个务实的原则是<strong>让缺失成为显式状态</strong>：主数据允许 <code>dimensionSource = UNKNOWN</code> 并携带可信度区间，而不是填一个看起来合理的默认值。默认值是沉默的谎言，会让下游算法产生虚假的精确感；显式的&quot;未知&quot;则强迫求解器进入保守分支或触发人工补录。这呼应装载系统那条基本纪律——<strong>宁可保守，不可虚报</strong>，因为虚报的代价同时落在装载率、体积重账单和 VGM 合规三处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>包装主数据是<strong>嵌套层级树</strong>（Item → Inner Pack → Carton → Pallet → Container），每层有独立的尺寸、重量与标识；混合层级的记录是装载率下降的隐形主因。</li>\n<li>标识体系用 GS1/AI 表达：<code>(01)</code> GTIN 标识&quot;哪类货&quot;，<code>(00)</code> SSCC 标识&quot;哪托货&quot;，<code>(02)+(37)</code> 表达内装嵌套，包装类型用 UN/ECE 第 21 号建议书代码。</li>\n<li>尺寸可信度取决于来源方法（量方设备 &gt; 手持测量 &gt; 目测），重量受 SOLAS/IMO 的 VGM 强制约束（2016-07-01 起），体积重按承运商除数把尺寸误差转化为<strong>双重计费</strong>。</li>\n<li>主数据必须给足 Cartonization 的自由度与约束：<code>allowRotation</code> / <code>thisSideUp</code> / <code>stackable</code> / <code>maxStackWeight</code>，并区分裸件与含零售包装尺寸。</li>\n<li>治理核心是<strong>来源分级 + 周期性复核</strong>，并让&quot;未知&quot;成为显式状态而非静默默认值，避免下游算法产生虚假的精确感。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包装主数据模型：SKU 尺寸重量、包装层级与 Cartonization 装载单元","id":"包装主数据模型-sku-尺寸重量-包装层级与-cartonization-装载单元"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"尺寸与重量的测量、单位与容差","id":"尺寸与重量的测量-单位与容差"},{"level":2,"text":"GS1 标识体系与装载单元的交汇","id":"gs1-标识体系与装载单元的交汇"},{"level":2,"text":"Cartonization：从物品集合到装载单元","id":"cartonization-从物品集合到装载单元"},{"level":2,"text":"主数据质量与治理的工程化","id":"主数据质量与治理的工程化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"3D 装载问题形式化：容器、货物、约束与目标函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/loading-problem-packaging-data-model/3d-loading-problem-formalization"},"next":{"title":"可堆叠性与物理属性建模：承重、朝向限制与易碎危品标记","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/loading-problem-packaging-data-model/stackability-physical-attribute-modeling"}}